@AddisEats.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174

### Invalid restaurant ID: the :int route constraint returns 404
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants/abc
Accept: application/json

### Search across repeated areas
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants?areas=Bole&areas=Piassa
Accept: application/json

### Unknown query keys return 400 unknown_query_parameter
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants?areaa=Bole
Accept: application/json

### An omitted areas filter returns every restaurant
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants
Accept: application/json

### Restaurant by ID
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants/1
Accept: application/json

### Search restaurants by name
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants?name=Habesha%20Table
Accept: application/json

### Create an order (201 Created and a Location header)
POST {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemIds": [1, 2]
}

### Fetch the created order using the ID returned above
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/1
Accept: application/json
